# Route: guide 38 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 54 to 56, 61
# quests, 4.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Western Plaguelands, Tirisfal Glades, Eastern Plaguelands): Sorrow
# Hill -> Ruins of Andorhal -> Felstone Field -> Northridge Lumber Camp ->
# Felstone Field -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Hearthglen -> The Weeping Cave
# -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Hearthglen -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Sorrow
# Hill -> Ruins of Andorhal -> ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Barov Family Fortune (5343), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the
# Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper
# (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848),
# Remember That I Love You (92415), Crest of Lordaeron (95189), Bloodied
# Insignia (95195), Abominable Creatures (95250), Dawn's Gambit (4771), The
# Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi
# (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243), The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond
# (5263), The Restless Souls (5282), Menethil's Gift (5463), Plagued
# Hatchlings (5529), Dead Man's Plea (8945), Anthion's Old Friend (8948).

